1.1.0
- show money spent in temple
- proper kill verbs for fellow bros: chopped, stabbed, shot in the back, ... joined with commas
- track real food and whatever prices for TCO
- singular forms for counts of one
Compatibility:
- fixed Reforged 0.8.9+ incompat
- Pandora's Hobby compat
- Career Stats compat, show both mods' obituary lines
- translation now needs Rosetta 0.4.0+
Fixes:
- report missing stdlib with a popup, not a script error
- don't log an error on deaths without a killer
- don't charge destroyed shields as tools
- fixed food counted eaten when no food
- fixed food price for TCO sometimes lower than paid
- fixed last combat not recorded for a bro who died or was left to die in it
- fixed crash when a bro is injured with no attacker
- fixed killed enemies staying alive in main menu scenarios
- fixed gutted and smashed swapped
- fixed fallen's old self-inflicted deaths shown as from a hand of a bro
- fixed part of the costs tooltip left untranslated
- fixed "Failed to load fallen FunFacts" errors on every load

